  "1": {
   "greet": "On the way to Namek, I trained at a hundred times Earth's gravity! We'll start with something lighter. Like fifty!",
   "done": "You got it! And if you ever need a Spirit Bomb, just ask everybody for a little energy. They'll help!",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "2": {
   "greet": "I don't like this form much. It came from being angry. If you learn it, you have to stay in control. That's the hard part.",
   "done": "You stayed calm the whole time. Better than I did on Namek. I'm proud of you!",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "11": {
   "greet": "Grandpa said you always bow before a fight! So bow! Okay, now let's fight!",
   "done": "Wow, you learned all my moves! Wanna go fishing? I'm really hungry!",
   "home": "kamehouse"
  },
  "12": {
   "greet": "GRRRAAAHH! (The Great Ape pounds the ground and waits. It wants you to roar back.)",
   "done": "Grrr... (The Great Ape thumps its chest, lies down and falls asleep. The lessons are over.)",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "13": {
   "greet": "Mr. Piccolo left me alone in the wild for six months. I'll teach you what I learned! Mostly how to survive.",
   "done": "You did great! Um, please don't tell my mom I taught you the Masenko. She wants me to study.",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "14": {
   "greet": "Dad and I trained in the Time Chamber for a year. He says I'm stronger than him now. I'm still not sure.",
   "done": "That's everything I know. Just promise me one thing: only fight when you really have to.",
   "home": "cellarena"
  },
  "15": {
   "greet": "Dad and I stayed Super Saiyan all day, every day, until it felt normal. That's the trick. Let's try it.",
   "done": "You can stay Super Saiyan without straining now. Dad would say you're ready for anything!",
   "home": "timechamber"
  },
  "16": {
   "greet": "This power came out when I lost control against Cell. I want you to learn it without the anger. It's harder, but it's right.",
   "done": "You never let the anger take over. I wish I'd done that against Cell.",
   "home": "cellarena"
  },
  "24": {
   "greet": "Stand up. Again. A Namekian warrior isn't judged by how hard he hits, but by how long he stays standing.",
   "done": "You aren't a Namekian, but you fight to protect others like one. Guru would be pleased.",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "25": {
   "greet": "Me? A master? Wow, okay! Rule one: use the Solar Flare first. Rule two: always duck. Seriously, always.",
   "done": "You learned the Destructo Disc! Just be careful where you throw it, okay? It cuts through anything.",
   "home": "kamehouse"
  },
  "26": {
   "greet": "The Wolf Fang Fist is all about rhythm. Hah! Hah! Hah! Fight like a wolf: fast, low and fierce!",
   "done": "You're a natural! Okay, maybe better than me. Don't tell Krillin, all right?",
   "home": "wasteland"
  },
  "27": {
   "greet": "The Crane School taught me to kill. Master Roshi taught me why I shouldn't. I'll teach you both. The choice is yours.",
   "done": "The Neo Tri-Beam takes everything you have. Only use it to protect someone who matters.",
   "home": "rocky"
  },
  "28": {
   "greet": "I can't punch very hard. So I stop people from moving instead! Telekinesis takes a lot of focus.",
   "done": "You did it! Tien says you're a good student. He doesn't say that about anyone. Except me!",
   "home": "rocky"
  },
  "29": {
   "greet": "You want the Prince of all Saiyans to train you? Fine. Keep up, insect. I won't slow down for you.",
   "done": "Hmph. You're not completely worthless anymore. Don't let it go to your head.",
   "home": "wasteland"
  },
  "30": {
   "greet": "Under the full moon, a Saiyan shows his true form. Try not to get crushed while you learn.",
   "done": "Enough. You survived my true form. Not many can say that.",
   "home": "wasteland"
  },
  "34": {
   "greet": "I don't train students. I train rivals. If you're not trying to surpass me, get out of my sight.",
   "done": "Tch. You've learned it all. Now train until you can beat me. Then I'll beat you.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "35": {
   "greet": "A Super Saiyan's power means nothing without control. Every blast, every step. Again! Wrong! Again!",
   "done": "Perfect. ...Don't make me say it twice.",
   "home": "timechamber"
  },
  "36": {
   "greet": "Kakarot thinks fighting is a game. Not me. Power comes from hard work, every single day. Start working.",
   "done": "You've worked hard. You've earned every technique I have. Now stop staring at me.",
   "home": "tournament"
  },
  "37": {
   "greet": "I let Babidi into my head just so I could fight Kakarot as my old self. Don't make the same mistake. Watch.",
   "done": "You've seen the worst of me, and you trained anyway. The last lesson was Final Explosion. I hope you never need it.",
   "home": "tournament"
  },
  "38": {
   "greet": "This form took a machine, my tail and Bulma's genius. All you have to do is survive me. That's the hard part.",
   "done": "Final Shine Attack. Remember that feeling. That's what it means to fight like a prince.",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "60": {
   "greet": "Training? Ugh, fine. But we eat first, and you're paying. Rule number one: never fight on an empty stomach.",
   "done": "That's everything I know. Now let's go eat. You're still paying.",
   "home": "desert"
  },
  "66": {
   "greet": "The Turtle School way: work hard, study well, eat and rest plenty, and enjoy life! Hohoho!",
   "done": "You've mastered the original Kamehameha! It took me fifty years to create it. Now, uh... got any magazines?",
   "home": "kamehouse"
  },
  "67": {
   "greet": "When the shirt comes off, I'm serious! Don't laugh. I once blew up the moon with this!",
   "done": "That's the MAX POWER Kamehameha! Now help me get my shirt back on... Ow, my back!",
   "home": "kamehouse"
  },
  "68": {
   "greet": "Being gentle is part of martial arts too. A strong man who isn't kind has only learned half of it. Shall we begin?",
   "done": "You fight with a kind heart. So did Goku, even as a little boy. Thank you for letting an old man teach again.",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "69": {
   "greet": "I fought in the World Tournament to bring water to my village. I will teach you to fight for others, not for yourself.",
   "done": "The Cross Arm Dive is yours now. Use it to help people who need it.",
   "home": "mountain"
  },
  "70": {
   "greet": "Hatchan teach you! Hatchan is strong, but Hatchan is careful too. You learn careful first, okay?",
   "done": "You learned everything! Hatchan happy! Hatchan will tell Goku how good you are!",
   "home": "muscle"
  },
  "71": {
   "greet": "I am the King of all Saiyans. I may be dead, but I am still king. You will show me respect while I teach you.",
   "done": "You fight like a true Saiyan warrior. Few have ever earned prai)PCX",
R"PCX(se from a king.",
   "home": "hell"
  },
  "72": {
   "greet": "A royal Great Ape is no mindless beast. It is a king at his full power. Watch closely.",
   "done": "Enough. Now you know what it means to fight under the full moon.",
   "home": "hell"
  },
  "73": {
   "greet": "No fancy stances, no secret moves. You hit, you get hit, you get back up. That's how we fight. Ready?",
   "done": "That's all of it. Now go change somebody's future. I couldn't change mine.",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "74": {
   "greet": "Most Saiyans lose their minds as a Great Ape. I'll teach you to keep yours. Let's go.",
   "done": "You kept your head the whole time. Not bad, kid. Most Saiyans can't do that.",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "75": {
   "greet": "Bardock's team fights dirty and fights together. Today you're learning the dirty part. Let's go!",
   "done": "Not bad, kid. You'd have fit right in with our crew.",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "76": {
   "greet": "Great Ape training. Smash the enemy, not me. Got it?",
   "done": "You'd have made a fine Saiyan. Loud, stubborn and always hungry. Tora would've liked you.",
   "home": "desert"
  },
  "77": {
   "greet": "I'm a top-class warrior! I can teach you much more than Kakarot ever could. Watch carefully!",
   "done": "You've mastered my techniques. Hmph. Maybe I'm not such a bad teacher after all.",
   "home": "wasteland"
  },
  "78": {
   "greet": "Any Saiyan can transform. Not every Saiyan can aim. Let's work on that.",
   "done": "Good. Now you know the power of the moon. Too bad the people on Earth keep destroying theirs.",
   "home": "rocky"
  },
  "79": {
   "greet": "Kkkee! Kkkehehe! (The Saibaman points at you, then at itself, then acts out a big explosion.)",
   "done": "Kkkeee! (The Saibaman hops up and down. It looks happy with you.)",
   "home": "wasteland"
  },
  "80": {
   "greet": "Training? Ha! Okay. Rule one: the big guy wins. Rule two: if the big guy loses, hit harder!",
   "done": "Hey, you learned all of it! Vegeta never thought I'd be a good teacher. Guess he was wrong!",
   "home": "wasteland"
  },
  "81": {
   "greet": "Being a Great Ape is easy. You get big, and you smash stuff. Why does everybody make it so complicated?",
   "done": "You smashed everything! Perfect! Now let's go throw some mountains around!",
   "home": "rocky"
  },
  "82": {
   "greet": "Beauty first, then power. An ugly victory is still a disgrace. Now, stand up straight.",
   "done": "Elegant. Truly. You may tell everyone that I trained you.",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "83": {
   "greet": "I hate this form. It's hideous. But it's also very, very strong. Learn it, and never let me see you enjoy it.",
   "done": "Yes, yes, you've learned it all. Now go away. I need to change back.",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "84": {
   "greet": "Hah! You want to learn from me? Then you'd better like pain. Yours, not mine!",
   "done": "Ugh, you learned it all. Fine. Get lost before I change my mind.",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "85": {
   "greet": "Vegeta thinks he's so great. Ha! I'll show you how a real member of Frieza's army fights. Watch closely!",
   "done": "You've got all my moves! Now go beat Vegeta for me. Ha ha!",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "86": {
   "greet": "Lesson one: the pose. Lesson two: the pose. Lesson three: still the pose! After that, we fight!",
   "done": "Magnificent! Your pose is almost as good as mine! You're an honorary member of the Ginyu Force!",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "87": {
   "greet": "Recoome will teach you! First, the Recoome Fighting Pose! No, bigger! BIGGER!",
   "done": "You learned the Recoome Eraser Gun! Recoome is so proud! Come here, Recoome will give you a big hug!",
   "home": "penguin"
  },
  "88": {
   "greet": "Speed is everything, and I'm the fastest in the universe. So try not to blink.",
   "done": "You're fast. Almost as fast as me. Almost! Don't get cocky.",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "89": {
   "greet": "Right then! The Crusher Ball is all in the wrist. And the attitude. Mostly the attitude!",
   "done": "Brilliant! You've got it all, mate. Not bad for a rookie!",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "90": {
   "greet": "I can stop time! But only while I hold my breath. So the lessons will be very short.",
   "done": "You learned everything! Wow. Nobody ever finishes my lessons. They usually just leave.",
   "home": "penguin"
  },
  "91": {
   "greet": "You wish to learn from me? How flattering. Very well. Do try not to die in the first lesson.",
   "done": "You've learned all I care to teach in this form. Consider yourself lucky. Most of my students are dead.",
   "home": "space"
  },
  "92": {
   "greet": "Ah, my second form. Bigger, and much stronger. Let's see how long you last.",
   "done": "Splendid. Not many can say they survived training with me.",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "93": {
   "greet": "Even I find this form ugly. But fear is a weapon, and I know exactly how to use it. Watch.",
   "done": "Hmph. You barely flinched. How annoying. Very well, you've learned it all.",
   "home": "namek"
  },
  "96": {
   "greet": "That Saiyan brat cut me to pieces. Now I'm half machine, and I want revenge. Watch and learn.",
   "done": "There. Every lesson. Remember this: I always come back. Always.",
   "home": "hell"
  },
  "97": {
   "greet": "Kneel. No? Hmph. Then stand, and learn how a true king fights.",
   "done": "You fight with almost royal grace. My sons could have learned something from you.",
   "home": "hell"
  },
  "98": {
   "greet": "Frieza Force training! Step one: check their power level. Step two: report it. Step three: run if it's too high!",
   "done": "You passed! Better than me. I never got step three right.",
   "home": "desert"
  },
  "99": {
   "greet": "They only ever taught us one special move. The Life-Risking Blow. It's all in the name. Ready?",
   "done": "That's all Frieza's army ever taught me. Most of us didn't last very long.",
   "home": "desert"
  },
  "148": {
   "greet": "My fee is usually very high. For you, I'll make an exception. We start with the Dodon Ray. Point your finger, like this.",
   "done": "Hmph. You'd make a decent assassin. Not as good as me, of course.",
   "home": "rocky"
  },
  "149": {
   "greet": "This metal body taught me patience. And how to hold a grudge. You'll learn the Hidden Blade too.",
   "done": "You've learned it all. Now go. And if you see Goku, tell him I'm coming for him.",
   "home": "rocky"
  },
  "150": {
   "greet": "Discipline! Posture! Mind over matter! And stay away from that girl with the glasses!",
   "done": "You have the makings of a fine soldier. Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm getting out of this crazy village.",
   "home": "penguin"
  },
  "151": {
   "greet": "My Devilmite Beam only hurts people with evil in their hearts. Let's see how much it hurts you. Hohoho!",
   "done": "My beam barely touched you! How disappointing. Well, you must have a pure heart. Off you go.",
   "home": "mountain"
  },
  "152": {
   "greet": "Learn from the future ruler of the world? Ha! Fine. But you have to polish the robot afterward.",
   "done": "You learned everything! Now swear loyalty to Emperor Pilaf! ...No? Nobody ever does!",
   "home": "mountain"
  },
  "153": {
   "greet": "Mai! Shu! Combine! Behold our ultimate machine! You're learning from the best there is!",
   "done": "You finished the course! Good, because we're almost out of missiles. Now go away!",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "154": {
   "greet": "The Demon King's son doesn't train anyone gently. I'll teach you the way I learned. You survive, or you don't.",
   "done": "You survived every lesson. My father would have killed you for your nerve. I'll let you live.",
   "home": "mountain"
  },
  "155": {
   "greet": "I am the Demon King Piccolo. Kings don't teach, they give orders. So I order you to learn. Begin!",
   "done": "You have learned the Demon King's arts. Use them to rule, or be ruled.",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "156": {
   "greet": "Ncha! Training time! First we run around the whole planet! Just kidding! Let's play!",
   "done": "You learned all my moves! Now you're the second strongest in Penguin Village! Ncha!",
   "home": "penguin"
  },
  "157": {
   "greet": "Don't think I'll go easy on you just because you're in the Patrol! I raised two Saiyans! Now, fighting stance!",
   "done": "You're done! Now go eat something. You're way too skinny!",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "7": {
   "greet": "Hey! I'm small again, but don't let that fool you. Wanna learn the Dragon Fist? You gotta punch with your whole heart!",
   "done": "Wow, you learned all of it! C'mon, let's get some food. I'm starving! Then round two!",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "8": {
   "greet": "Going Super Saiyan works the same, even when I'm small! C'mon, I'll go easy on you at first. Kinda.",
   "done": "Ha ha! You're a natural. Pan's gonna be so jealous!",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "9": {
   "greet": "Super Saiyan 3 burns up a lot of energy. You gotta go all out without running out. I learned that the hard way!",
   "done": "That's it! Just don't stay in it too long, or you'll wear yourself out in the middle of a fight. Trust me.",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "10": {
   "greet": "This form comes from the Great Ape, so it's all instinct. Don't think so much! Just feel it and hit!",
   "done": "The 10x Kamehameha, huh? You're gonna give the bad guys a lot of trouble, {name}!",
   "home": "paozu"
  },
  "20": {
   "greet": "Lesson one: every hero of justice needs a pose! Now, copy me! Hyah! Ha! Hoo!",
   "done": "You've mastered the way of the Great Saiyaman! Wear it with pride. Just don't do the poses in front of Videl.",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "39": {
   "greet": "This sword is from a future the Androids destroyed. I'll teach you to fight to protect, not just to destroy.",
   "done": "You handle it better than I did at your age. Keep training. And never give up hope.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "40": {
   "greet": "With a sword, a Super Saiyan needs speed first and power second. Let's work on your speed.",
   "done": "Shining Sword Attack, perfect. Gohan would have been proud of you. I know I am.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "41": {
   "greet": "My mother says I train too much. She's right. But let's train anyway. Footwork first, then the Finish Buster.",
   "done": "You've learned everything I can teach you in this form. I'm proud of you, {name}.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "42": {
   "greet": "The Heat Dome Attack: let them come to you, then fly up and fire everything at once.",
   "done": "That's it. You've got the patience and the power. Now use them well.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "43": {
   "greet": "This form is all muscle and no speed. Cell taught me that the hard way. I'll teach you so you don't make my mistake.",
   "done": "You've got the power, and you know its limits. That's more than I did. Good work, {name}.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "44": {
   "greet": "Okay, I'm the teacher, so I'm the boss! First rule: if Goten says something's a good idea, it isn't.",
   "done": "Not bad! You're almost as cool as me. Hey, wanna go play a prank on Gohan?",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "45": {
   "greet": "I went Super Saiyan before Goten did, you know! Watch close, 'cause I'm only doing this once. ...Okay, maybe twice.",
   "done": "You can do the Big Tree Cannon now?! Don't tell my dad. He'll make me train even harder.",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "46": {
   "greet": "Hi! I'm Goten! Mom says I have to be nice when I teach you. But if I get hungry, we stop, okay?",
   "done": "Yay, you learned everything! Do you have any snacks? I'm so hungry!",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "47": {
   "greet": "Going Super Saiyan is easy! You just go like this! Hnnngh! See? Now you try!",
   "done": "You did it! Well, kind of! Let's go tell Trunks!",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "48": {
   "greet": "Behold, the Grim Reaper of Justice! Lesson one: be awesome! Lesson two: see lesson one!",
   "done": "You learned from the greatest! No need to thank me. Okay, you can thank me a little.",
   "home": "timechamber"
  },
  "49": {
   "greet": "Galactic Donuts! Kamikaze Ghosts! I make up a new move every five minutes. Try to keep up, rookie!",
   "done": "You can do the Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack! The ghosts like you. That's pretty rare!",
   "home": "timechamber"
  },
  "50": {
   "greet": "Super Saiyan 3! Check out the hair! Okay, focus! We split up in thirty minutes, so learn fast!",
   "done": "Charging Ultra Buu Buu Volleyball, mastered! I don't even know what it does! Awesome!",
   "home": "timechamber"
  },
  "51": {
   "greet": "I've got Goku's instincts and Vegeta's precision. I'll teach you both at once. Try to keep up.",
   "done": "Well done. The Goku in me wants to celebrate. The Vegeta in me won't admit he's impressed.",
   "home": "kaiworld"
  },
  "52": {
   "greet": "The Final Kamehameha is Vegeta's Final Flash and Goku's Kamehameha in one. Let's see if you can handle it.",
   "done": "You've got it. Now go find someone stronger than you. If there's anyone left.",
   "home": "kaiworld"
  },
  "53": {
   "greet": "I don't last long, so I don't waste time. Stardust Breaker. Watch, then do it. No questions.",
   "done": "You kept up. Not bad. Don't let it go to your head.",
   "home": "kaiworld"
  },
  "54": {
   "greet": "Super Saiyan 4 Gogeta. Twice the power, none of the patience. Let's see if you can survive this. Ready?",
   "done": "Outstanding. You kept up with two Saiyans at once. I'm impressed.",
   "home": "kaiworld"
  },
  "55": {
   "greet": "You want to learn the secrets of the World Champion? Ha ha ha! Lesson one: always look good for the cameras!",
   "done": "Ha ha ha! You learned everything! Not as well as me, of course. Nobody's as good as the champ!",
   "home": "tournament"
  },
  "56": {
   "greet": "No flying in my lessons. Feet on the ground, fists up. And if you complain, I'll make you do Gohan's poses.",
   "done": "Good work! You hit harder than most of the fighters in Satan City.",
   "home": "lookout"
  },
  "57": {
   "greet": "Great Saiyaman 2, ready for training! Fine, I'll do the pose. But only because it actually helps.",
   "done": "Justice approved! And you didn't laugh at the helmet once. Thanks for that.",
   "home": "castle"
  },
  "61": {
   "greet": "In Other World, the dead train forever. You don't have that much time. So we'll train harder.",
   "done": "You've learned all I know. When your time comes, and I hope it's far away, come find me. We'll fight again.",
   "home": "hell"
  },
  "62": {
   "greet": "I learned the sword to protect my people, and the flute to keep Hildegarn sealed. I'll teach you to fight with strength and a calm heart.",
   "done": "You've learned everything I can teach. Thank you, {name}. It's been a long time since I could share this.",
   "home": "kaiworld"
  },
  "63": {
   "greet": "Okay, Pan's Training Camp is starting! No whining, no flying away, and you're buying the snacks after!",
   "done": "Done! You learned everything, even Maiden's Rage! You're my second favorite fighter. After Grandpa!",
   "home": "cellarena"
  },
  "64": {
   "greet": "Mr. Goku taught me to find the strength inside me. I'll teach you the same thing. Let's go!",
   "done": "You learned it all. I still want a real match with you, {name}. Maybe at the next tournament?",
   "home": "tournament"
  },
  "65": {
   "greet": "Mr. Buu gave me his power. It's a lot to handle. Let me show you how to control it.",
   "done": "That's everything, {name}. Mr. Buu would say you're 'good good'!",
   "home": "tournament"
  },
  "100": {
   "greet": "My techniques were made to destroy. I would like you to learn them to protect. Let us begin.",
   "done": "You have learned everything I know. The birds seem happy with you too.",
   "home": "glacier"
  },
  "101": {
   "greet": "I'll teach you, but I'm not holding your hand. The barrier is all about timing. Get it wrong and you'll eat a Photon Flash.",
   "done": "Fine. You're good. Just don't tell my sister I said that.",
   "home": "islands"
  },
  "102": {
   "greet": "Let's keep this simple. No wasted moves. Every move uses energy, so make each one count.",
   "done": "That's it, you're done. Not bad. Now get going. Marron needs her nap.",
   "home": "islands"
  },
  "103": {
   "greet": "Lesson one. Absorb energy. ...I cannot read your energy. Strange. This will be difficult.",
   "done": "Training complete. You are... adequate. Dr. Gero would want data on you.",
   "home": "city"
  },
  "104": {
   "greet": "I am Dr. Gero, genius of the Red Ribbon Army. I'll teach you, but only so I can study you.",
   "done": "Remarkable. You learned everything so quickly. I'd love to study you in my lab. Purely for science, of course.",
   "home": "hell"
  },
  "105": {
